1 CONC Fannie was the nurse who cared for Aunt Maggie whose death from an automobile accident was apparently lingering.  After she married Robert Lutkie, she apparently kept in touch with the Kneer family and was referred to as "Aunt Fannie" according t
1 CONC o Velma Kneer Larson.
