1 CONT EDMUND JOHNS was a Baptist minister in Campbell County, VA for 40 year s. He served Ebenezer Baptist Church and New Chapel Baptist Church.  Fr om "Virginia Baptist Ministers," series 1, by James B. Taylor (publish ed in 1859).
