1 CONT JOSEPH B. JOHNS settled in Tennessee in 1801.  He lived briefly in Giles C o., TN and then settled in Rutherford Co., TN.  He served in West Tenness ee Militia during the War of 1812.  He enlisted 10 Dec 1812 and serv ed in the infantry under Col
1 CONC . Hall and Capt. Newton.
1 CONT
1 CONT JOSEPH B. JOHNS received a land grant August 1831 for 71 acres in Rutherfo rd Co., TN.
1 CONT
1 CONT JOSEPH B. JOHNS' date of death, 8 October 1839, was recorded in the Maj or Family Bible.
1 CONT
