1 CONT "Jeremiah McKay, Shenandoah Co., State of Va, 30 Dec 1790 gives power of attorney to David Job... and Abraham McKay... to demand and sue for money belonging to me respecting the settlement and recovery of my wife's part of the estate of Joseph Whi
1 CONC tson, deceased..."  -- Hunter B. McKay.  The McKay's and Allied Families, p. 234
