1 CONC "They were Methodists and among the first of that denomination in western Virginia.  About the year, 1804, he moved to Sullivan County Tennessee, and in the fall of 1809, he moved from there to Preble County, Ohio, then a wilderness, where he resi
1 CONC ded until his death.  -- Stephens, Dan V.  Stephens family Genealogies.   p. unnumbered [4]
