1 CONC h 1 Negro. Suanah Nelson 1 bed and furniture, 1 woman's saddle, $60 being the 5th part of the money Robert Taylor owes me. The balance he owes of $240 to be divided between Hartwell Honeycutt, dau. Mary Honeycut, George Nelson, husband to my grand
1 CONC dau., Polly Nelson, John Davenport, husband to my granddau. Rebecca Davenport, Cynthia Taylor my great-grand dau., (to be paid on her marriage or when she is of age.)  Extra: Jonathan Hampton, Robert Taylor. Wit.: James Bradley, John Ballard.  Th
