1 CONC "Funeral Services Held for Mrs. Myrtle Triplett
1 CONT "Funeral services for Mrs. Myrtle Stowell Triplett were held at the Lewis Bros. Funeral home at 3 p.m. yesterday.  The Rev. W.E. Sutterfield officiated and burial was in Greenwood cemetery.
1 CONT "Mrs Triplett passed away Saturday in Omaha, Neb.  She was a Sister-in-law of Mrs. Mary Neher of Palmyra, Mrs Harry Carson of Philadelphia, Harvey and Warwick Triplett of Palmyra.
1 CONT "Mrs Triplett was a former resident of Quincy and Chicago, moving to Omaha after the death of her husband, Howard B. Triplett, who died June 25, 1953.
