1 CONC eft. is skipper;  with costs.  Deft. admits that pltf. has earned so much on said ketch, but that he cannot pay unless being thereunto constrained by the Court.  The court orders deft. to pay said monthly wages to the pltf. inasmuch as the pltf. h
