1 CONC Harold Hunt was a Baptist minister in Missouri. He served at Bethel Baptist Church, near Palmyra, and may also have been associated with La Grange College.  He married Kathryn Taylor and Othel Mitchell without the knowledge of her parents, which s
1 CONC eems a bit strange as they were staunch Bethel parishioners and, presumably family friends.
