1 CONT Joined the Baptists and was disowned by the Quakers. --- O'Dell. Over the Misty Blue Hills, p. 103
1 CONT Was called Lieutenant Colonel and removed to Cocke Co., Tenn. --- O'Dell. Over the Misty Blue Hills, p. 113
