1 CONC irths of some of their children.
1 CONT "Before 1754, William Whitson moved to the Shenandoah Valley of Virginia, in Augusta Co.  During the Indian raids of the late 1770's, William Whitson and several sons moved into the area that is present-day Washington/Carter County, Tenn.
1 CONT At the time of his death in 1783, William Whitson was living with his youngest son, Jesse Whitson, Washington Co. NC/TN. -- Allenbaugh
