1 CONC .  On September 17, 1948, he was married to Mrs Elizabeth McCormick in Bowling Green.  She survives.
1 CONT "Other survivors besides the wife include a daughter, Mrs. Floyd (Eunice) Crouch of Quincy; a grandson, Ronald Crouch, stationed with the Air Force in Morocco; a brother Robert McLeod of Independence; and three sisters, Mrs. J.B. Taylor of Palmyra
