1 CONC "The Heritage of Rutherford County North Carolina" Vol. 1
1 CONT "Samuel King, Jr. (1772-1849), m. September 20, 1792, Rutherford Co. NC. Mary Ashe Kelly of Rutherford Co. NC (1777-181_), lived in Rutherford Co. NC and Buncombe Co (Transylvania Co. now) NC. Buried in Glazner Cemetery Brevard, NC.  Sons: Jonatha
1 CONC n; Jeremiah. Daughters: Mary, others. m. 2nd: Rebecca Clark (1819)."
1 CONT
