1 CONT "...The second son, Samuel Junior, 1772-1849, married in 1792 to Mary Ashe Kelley, 1772-1812, daughter of Henry Kelly and Mary Whitesides.  After the death of his first wife, Samuel married Rebecca Clark in 1789 [sic], daughter of Samuel Clark, so
1 CONC ldier in the Revolutionary War.  Samuel [King] is buried in the Glazner Cemetery in Brevard, North Carolina."
