1 CONT "Jonathan king (1774-1859), m. December 5 [6?] 1798, Rutherford County N.C. Sarah Taylor (1775-1862) of Rutherford County, NC.  Lived in Rutherford Co NC; Buncombe Co.; Polk co. NC; buried King Cemetery... [lists sons and daughters]
