1 CONC ompanied by Mrs. G.G. Carlstead at the organ.  Burial was in Greenwood cemetery.  Casketbearers were Randles Summers, William Owsley, Robert Calvert, Richard Hamm and Norman Buckwalter.  Honorary casketbearers were the Deacons of the church and th
