1 CONT 6 Sep 1787: From EDUMUND JOHNS and Susannah, his wife, of Campbell C o. to Joseph Torrance of Campbell Co., for 50 pounds, 100 acres in Campbe ll Co. on the main branch of Naked Creek, being the tract of land convey ed to said JOHNS by Sarah Simps
1 CONC on by deed 10 Sep 1786.
