1 CONT
1 CONT 1794- JAMES JOHNS sold 300 acres to William Johns.
1 CONT
1 CONT 1795- JAMES JOHNS sold 113 acres to James Porter.
1 CONT
1 CONT 1798- JAMES JOHNS sold 100 acres to Charles Leauallen.
