1 CONC essrs Thad and Howard Smith and F.W. Smith, pianist.  Mr Carson was a highly respected citizen and leaves to mourn his departure Mr and Mrs Harvey Carson, Clarence Carson of Hannibal, William Carson of Seattle, Wash, a daughter, Mrs Schaffer of Ha
1 CONC nnibal.  Ilus Rhodes of Cherry Dell, Mrs Noah Swisher a sister of Mr Carson and Emmett Swisher and wife of Philadelphia attended the funeral."  --  Palmyra Spectator [?]. Date unknown
