1 CONC "Mrs. Bushong, Mr. Taylor Are Married
1 CONT "Mrs Margaret Palmer Bushong of Westport, N.Y. and Sarasota, Fla and J. Eugene Taylor were married on Jan 5 at the First Presbyterian Church in Naples Gla.  The Rev John Stump officiated at the 5:30 p.m. ceremony.
1 CONT "The bride and groom are making their home in Sarasota.
